<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="Architecture" id="log-arch"><mxGraphModel dx="1900" dy="1200" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1200" background="#ffffff"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
<mxCell id="t" value="DISTRIBUTED LOGGING - Architecture (Kafka → Flink → Cassandra + Elasticsearch + S3)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a237e" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="20" width="1740" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="agentLayer" value="AGENT LAYER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="1820" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="agents" value="FluentBit / OTEL Collector | Custom Agents&#10;Local buffer: 10MB disk, 24h retry | Batch: 100 logs OR 10s | Sampling: DEBUG 10%, ERROR 100%" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#bbdefb;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="110" width="900" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="edgeLayer" value="EDGE LAYER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3e0;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="200" width="1820" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="gateway" value="API GATEWAY + LOAD BALANCER&#10;JWT auth | Rate limit (10K logs/min per client) | Geo-routing | TLS termination" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffcc80;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="230" width="900" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="serviceLayer" value="SERVICE LAYER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="310" width="1820" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="ingestSvc" value="Ingestion Service&#10;&#10;Validate schema&#10;Enrich metadata&#10;Publish to Kafka&#10;Return 202 Accepted" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="360" width="220" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="searchSvc" value="Search Service&#10;&#10;Query routing&#10;Hot/Warm/Cold&#10;Elasticsearch DSL&#10;Cassandra CQL&#10;S3 Athena" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="360" width="200" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="alertSvc" value="Alert Service&#10;&#10;Rule evaluation&#10;Sliding window&#10;Cooldown (10 min)&#10;Deduplication&#10;PagerDuty/Slack" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="360" width="190" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="tailSvc" value="Real-Time Tail&#10;(WebSocket)&#10;&#10;Kafka consumer&#10;Filter + stream&#10;Backpressure buffer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="360" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="exportSvc" value="Export Service&#10;&#10;Async job queue&#10;S3 presigned URL&#10;CSV/JSON format&#10;Compliance GDPR" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1030" y="360" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="processingLayer" value="STREAM PROCESSING LAYER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="510" width="1820" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="flink" value="Apache Flink (32 parallel tasks)&#10;&#10;1. Validation (schema, required fields) → DLQ if malformed&#10;2. Parse + Normalize (syslog, JSON, custom → standard schema)&#10;3. Enrich (geo lookup, container metadata from K8s API)&#10;4. Deduplicate (5-min tumbling window, hash(ts_minute + service + msg[0:100]), RocksDB state)&#10;5. Watermark handling (5-min delay, accept logs up to 10 min late, DLQ if extremely late)&#10;6. Checkpoint every 60s to S3 (exactly-once recovery)&#10;7. Dual-write: Cassandra + Elasticsearch bulk API (5K batch) + Alert topic (if conditions match)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="560" width="1760" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="dataLayer" value="DATA + STORAGE LAYER" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="670" width="1820" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="kafka" value="Kafka&#10;raw_logs topic&#10;100 partitions&#10;key: client_id&#10;RF=3, acks=all&#10;Retention: 7 days&#10;Compression: Snappy" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="720" width="200" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cassandra" value="Cassandra&#10;&#10;logs_by_service&#10;PK: (service, date)&#10;CK: timestamp DESC&#10;TTL: 14 days&#10;&#10;logs_by_traceId&#10;PK: trace_id" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="720" width="220" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="es" value="Elasticsearch&#10;&#10;logs_2024-01-15 index&#10;Full-text search&#10;Aggregations&#10;ILM: 14-day rollover&#10;Query: sub-200ms" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="720" width="220" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s3" value="S3 (Cold Storage)&#10;&#10;Parquet + Snappy&#10;Partitioned by&#10;year/month/day/service&#10;Athena queries&#10;45+ days" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffebee;strokeColor=#c62828;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="720" width="200" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="pgClient" value="PostgreSQL&#10;&#10;ClientDB&#10;client_id, token&#10;preferences&#10;retention_policy&#10;namespace" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="720" width="180" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="pgAlert" value="PostgreSQL&#10;&#10;AlertRule DB&#10;alert_id, client_id&#10;condition (jsonb)&#10;cooldown_period&#10;notification_channels" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="720" width="220" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="redis" value="Redis&#10;&#10;Query cache&#10;TTL: 60s&#10;Frequent queries&#10;Metadata cache" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="720" width="160" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="e1" value="Publish" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="ingestSvc" target="kafka"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e2" value="Consume" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="kafka" target="flink"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e3" value="Write" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="flink" target="cassandra"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e4" value="Bulk index" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="flink" target="es"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e5" value="Query" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="searchSvc" target="es"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="e6" value="Fallback" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;dashed=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;fontSize=9" edge="1" parent="1" source="searchSvc" target="cassandra"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="why" value="WHY THESE CHOICES&#10;&#10;Kafka buffering decouples ingestion from processing: If Elasticsearch goes down, Kafka holds logs for hours/days without data loss. Agents publish to Kafka and walk away (async). RF=3, acks=all, min.insync.replicas=2 means 2 replicas must acknowledge before success — tolerates 1 broker failure. Enables replay if Flink logic changes.&#10;&#10;Flink deduplication with 5-min tumbling window + RocksDB state: Agents retry on network failures → duplicates arrive. Hash = (timestamp rounded to minute + service_name + first 100 chars of message). Flink keeps a set of seen hashes per 5-min window in RocksDB local state. If hash exists → drop; else → emit downstream. Catches 99% of duplicates. State expires when window closes (prevents unbounded growth). Cross-window duplicates not detected (acceptable trade-off).&#10;&#10;Cassandra for time-series write-optimized storage: Logs are append-only, queried by time range. Partition key = (service_name, log_date) → all logs for one service on one day on same node. Clustering key = timestamp DESC → chronological order. Write path: memtable → SSTable with LSM tree compaction. 10K writes/sec per node. TTL = 14 days → rows auto-delete without cleanup job. RF=3, QUORUM writes → tolerates 1 node failure.&#10;&#10;Elasticsearch for full-text search with inverted index: MySQL LIKE query on 1 billion rows = minutes. Elasticsearch inverted index: word → log IDs (like a book index at the back). Query: find logs containing NullPointerException from payment service in last 2h → jumps directly to matching entries in sub-200ms. Aggregations: count errors by service per hour = fast query. ILM policy: daily index rollover, auto-moves to warm tier after 14 days.&#10;&#10;Hot/Warm/Cold tiered storage saves 90% on costs: Hot (0-14 days): Cassandra SSD + Elasticsearch → sub-200ms → $0.10/GB/month. Warm (14-45 days): Cassandra HDD only → 1-2s → $0.05/GB/month. Cold (45+ days): S3 Parquet Snappy compressed → Athena queries → 10-30s → $0.01/GB/month. 99% of incident investigations query last 14 days. Example: 1TB/day → $3,000/mo (hot only) vs $300/mo (tiered).&#10;&#10;At-least-once delivery + deduplication pattern: Agents retry on failure (network, timeout) → at-least-once delivery. Better to risk duplicates than lose data. Flink centralizes dedup logic (99% effective). Alternative: idempotent upsert in DB with unique constraint → slower, locks, doesn't scale to 1M writes/sec.&#10;&#10;Watermarks handle late-arriving logs: Logs arrive out-of-order (network delays, container restarts). Watermark = event-time - 5 min. Flink waits 5 min before closing a window to accept late logs. Logs up to 10 min late → included in correct time window. Extremely late (10+ min) → Dead Letter Queue for manual review. Without watermarks, alert windows (ERROR count &gt; 100 in 5 min) would be wrong." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="900" width="1800" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
